OL,3,GNEWSALorraine Kelly misses show after
OL,4,AM40 crash closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV presenter Lorraine Kelly missed her
OL,7,Fmorning show after part of the M40 was
OL,8,Fshut due to a four-vehicle crash.
OL,10,FThe southbound carriageway was closed
OL,11,Fbetween junction 1A near Gerrards
OL,12,FCross, Buckinghamshire, and junction
OL,13,Fone for the M25 link road.
OL,15,FThames Valley Police said three people
OL,16,Fsuffered minor injuries in the
OL,17,Fcollision, which was first reported to
OL,18,FNational Highways at 05:45 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
