OL,3,GNEWSALorraine Kelly misses show after
OL,4,AM40 crash closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 66-year-old shared a post on
OL,7,FInstagram to explain why she was
OL,8,Fmissing from Lorraine on ITV, telling
OL,9,Fher followers she was stuck in traffic
OL,10,Ffor 90 minutes.
